+--------------------------------------------------------------+
|                 FIRE‑PREVENTION SUPERVISOR                   |
|                 (THERMAL + CURRENT + SHUTDOWN)               |
+--------------------------------------------------------------+

   POWER INPUT
   -----------
   [BAT+]----[FUSE]----+-------------------------------+
                       |                               |
                      [RSENSE]                         |
                       |                               |
                      NODE_I                           |
                                                        |
   [BAT-]------------------------------------------------+---- GND


   TEMPERATURE SENSE (ANTI‑FIRE)
   -----------------------------
   [NTC] 10kΩ thermistor mounted near hotspot
       |
      NODE_T ------------------------+
                                     |
   NODE_T --> [U1] Comparator        |
              IN+ = NODE_T           |
              IN- = T_REF (safe temp)|----> T_FAULT
                                     |
   T_FAULT ----[Q1] NPN----+---------+
                           |         
                           +----> SHUTDOWN_LINE


   CURRENT SENSE (SHORT / OVERLOAD)
   --------------------------------
   NODE_I --> [U2] Comparator
              IN+ = scaled NODE_I
              IN- = I_REF (max safe current)

   U2_OUT ----[Q2] NPN----+---------+
                           |         
                           +----> SHUTDOWN_LINE


   VOLTAGE MONITOR (BROWNOUT / OVERLOAD RISK)
   ------------------------------------------
   [BAT+]--divider--> NODE_V

   NODE_V --> [U3] Comparator
              IN+ = NODE_V
              IN- = V_MIN_REF

   U3_OUT ----[Q3] NPN----+---------+
                           |         
                           +----> SHUTDOWN_LINE


   SHUTDOWN LOGIC (FIRE PREVENTION)
   --------------------------------
   SHUTDOWN_LINE --> [Q4] NPN (master cutoff)
                      |
                      +----> DISABLE_DRIVER
                      |
                      +----> LED_FAULT (via R)

   DISABLE_DRIVER:
      - Pulls gate/base of main power transistor LOW
      - Ignores button input
      - Prevents thermal runaway
      - Prevents over‑current ignition
      - Prevents undervoltage stress


   OPTIONAL LATCH (MANUAL RESET)
   -----------------------------
   SHUTDOWN_LINE --> [Q5/Q6] latch pair
                      |
                      +----> requires RESET switch
                      |
   [RESET_SW]---- clears latch → re‑enable system

+--------------------------------------------------------------+
| BEHAVIOR                                                     |
| - If temp rises too high → immediate shutdown                |
| - If current spikes → immediate shutdown                     |
| - If voltage sags → shutdown (prevents overheating)          |
| - Fault LED lights                                           |
| - Optional latch prevents auto‑restart                       |
+--------------------------------------------------------------+
